{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1258031-can-why-talk-about-marxism-capitalism-andy-that-type-of-stuff","id":1258031,"title":"Can why talk About Marxism ,capitalism Andy that type of stuff","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-09-29T14:14:11-07:00","id":1258031,"title":"Can why talk About Marxism ,capitalism Andy that type of stuff","content":"Like why people blame communism for kmer Rouge and Gulugs but don\u2019t blame Capitalism for the Alantic slave trade ,Native American genocide and King Lepolds \u2018Congo Free State\u2019.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-10-08T05:13:04-07:00","id":1259569,"title":"","content":"As <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Social_democracy\" target=\"_blank\">Social Democrat</a> in my own homeland ( Poland ) I'm called 'Communist' for supporting our local party Razem ( eng. 'Together' ) that basis their plans on Scandinavian model. ( Even by my own father, to may I add. ) It's surely comes that we are post-Soviet country and general population is very hard Right Wing bend, both on de facto rules of Catholic Church and on Free Market business. Even when I'm rather modest Leftist - protesting for minorities and women's rights, separation of the State from the Church, supporting 'Fair Trade' in capitalism - I'm enemy for most of my compatriots. ( I do not even imagine how true Anti-capitalists are treated in our society. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )<br /> <br /> What I learned in my life and on this forum - each Left-Right separation model is different for each society - and from that - social classes can have different meanings. Still, in the end, all societies will create, in the end, high, middle and low class. Key is to help those on lower end. In that part, I agree with Marx. But not the whole social revolution - I think that peaceful protests on each subject are much better, even if longer taking, way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-06T13:22:39-08:00","id":1273139,"title":"","content":"I'm broadly a libertarian communist. My theoretical influences come from post-structuralism and the communization current.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thinking as I do that the Creator of this World is a very Cruel Being &amp; being a Worshipper of Christ, I cannot help saying: &quot;the Son, O how unlike the Father!&quot; First God Almighty comes with a Thump on the Head. Then Jesus Christ comes with a balm to heal it. - William Blake, Christian mystic and visionary","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/774-pilgrim","name":"Pilgrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar774_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T09:42:56-08:00","id":1361917,"title":"","content":"Good; you didn't confuse communism with democracy, as most do; I read a lot of books and I found a copy of the Communist Manifesto while living in Bariloche, Argentina (in English at a used book-store!). I've also read the Turner-Diaries and several books by Ayn Rand; what I can say are two things; &quot;The only thing I know is that I know nothing at all (because when one studies a subject, they realize just how much they don't know about it)&quot;, &quot;The more things change, the more they stay the same&quot;, &quot;True wisdom is realizing that other's lack wisdom (Socrates)&quot;, and, finally, that I am not good at math.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T09:56:11-08:00","id":1361920,"title":"","content":"Likely because it's something we do and we like to downplay the negative aspects (and past examples) of things we do. This can get so bad that it gets to the point of historical revisionism or further blame-shifting, 'Oh sure it was capitalism that caused it, but that was just the -Dutch-.'<br /> <br /> Especially since many of us are doing well. Even those who are not rich have running water, shelter, and if you're here, access to an international web of information. The idea that our way of life is bad because it has done so many bad things can often be shifted to think that 'we' are bad. And people don't like that, it causes stress, which means it's going to be pushed back against in some way or another.<br /> <br /> Also for a good portion of the western hemisphere people had it hammered into them young that communism was the bad one so there's a further inclination to weigh it heavier than anything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T10:00:45-08:00","id":1361923,"title":"","content":"Y'all are responding to a discussion from 2018.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-19T11:14:40-08:00","id":1361934,"title":"","content":"Sup. I mean Cuba sucks but those it suck more then any other Caribbean country.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-